{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbt","name":"Biblica® 聖經，當代譯本開放資源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbt","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBT","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: Biblica® 聖經,當代譯本開放資源 (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"b36dae22680d13a66a36842989888505161ddf7eefb726364331d95aae2197c4","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"MIC","translationId":"cmn_cbt","name":"彌迦書","commonName":"彌迦書","title":"彌迦書","order":33,"numberOfChapters":7,"sha256":"7653aa64f11ed5e86b64f5806ce4393d656010dca6eac643843bbaa97a4000ce","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/1.json","lastChapterNumber":7,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/7.json","totalNumberOfVerses":105},"chapter":{"number":6,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["耶和華譴責以色列"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"以色列人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要聽耶和華的話：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「起來，你們要在高山面前申辯，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓丘陵聽你們訴說。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"群山啊，大地永固的根基啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要聽耶和華的控告！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為耶和華要控告祂的子民，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"指控以色列人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"text":"「我的子民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我做了什麼對不起你們的事？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我哪裡令你們厭煩？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"回答我！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我曾帶你們出埃及，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"把你們從受奴役之地救贖出來，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"又差遣摩西、亞倫和米利暗引領你們。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我的子民啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要回想摩押王巴勒的陰謀以及比珥之子巴蘭給他的回答，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要回想你們從什亭到吉甲途中的遭遇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以便認識耶和華公義的作為。」","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"text":"我要拿什麼朝見耶和華，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在天上的上帝面前叩拜呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"要獻上一歲的牛犢作燔祭嗎？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華豈會喜愛成千的公羊和萬條油河？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我豈可因過犯而獻上自己的長子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因心中的罪惡而獻上親生的骨肉？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"世人啊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"耶和華已經指示你們何為良善。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂向你們所要的是什麼呢？","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"是要你們行公義，好憐憫，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"謙卑地與你們的上帝同行。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"text":"智者必敬畏耶和華的名，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"祂在向耶路撒冷呼喊：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"「聚在你裡面的眾人都要聽！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我豈會忘記惡人家中的不義之財和可惡的小升斗？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我豈會放過使用不公道的秤和砝碼的人？","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你的富人殘暴成性，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"居民謊話連篇，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"滿口詭詐之言。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以，我要重重地擊打你，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因你的罪惡而毀滅你。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你吃，卻吃不飽，仍然腹中空空。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你聚斂錢財，卻保不住。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你保住的，我要交給刀劍。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你撒種，卻不得收割；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你榨橄欖，卻無油抹身；","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你踩葡萄，卻無酒可喝。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":16,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因為你遵守暗利的惡規，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"效法亞哈家的惡行，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"隨從他們的計謀，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所以我要使你荒涼，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"讓你的居民成為笑柄。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你們要蒙受列國的羞辱。」","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/6.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/7.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbt/MIC/5.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":16}